{"version":2,"slug":"explore-los-angeles-with-me-slow-english-listening-practice","videoId":"f7hbRzPGl3o","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/f7hbRzPGl3o","lang":"en","title":"Explore Los Angeles With Me | Slow English Listening Practice","category":"Vlog","channel":"Speak English with Bo's Slow English","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@BoSlowEnglish","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Video","easy English","tv series"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Hello everyone. Welcome to a new episode"},{"start":3,"text":"of Bow's Slow English."},{"start":7,"text":"In today's episode, we are going to take"},{"start":11,"text":"a walk."},{"start":13,"text":"The walk will be a beautiful experience"},{"start":17,"text":"because it is sunny"},{"start":20,"text":"with a light breeze. Do you know the"},{"start":24,"text":"word breeze? It is another word for a"},{"start":28,"text":"light wind."},{"start":31,"text":"I just finished having lunch with some"},{"start":34,"text":"friends. We ate Korean food"},{"start":38,"text":"and I am having a lovely day and I hope"},{"start":43,"text":"you are as well."},{"start":45,"text":"Before we head out of the car and go"},{"start":49,"text":"take a stroll, which means to take a"},{"start":53,"text":"nice walk,"},{"start":55,"text":"I would like to invite you to download"},{"start":59,"text":"your free copy of my ebook. It is all"},{"start":64,"text":"about phrasal verbs. In the free copy,"},{"start":69,"text":"there is one category. It's about"},{"start":72,"text":"morning routine."},{"start":75,"text":"Phrasal verbs morning routine"},{"start":78,"text":"examples would be to get up out of bed"},{"start":83,"text":"to"},{"start":85,"text":"wake up"},{"start":87,"text":"to"},{"start":89,"text":"wash up before having breakfast. These"},{"start":92,"text":"are all important phrases to know."},{"start":96,"text":"And if you're interested in the full"},{"start":100,"text":"version, you can purchase it now. It's"},{"start":104,"text":"90 phrasal verbs and you can get $5 off"},{"start":111,"text":"if you are one of the first 50"},{"start":114,"text":"customers. I also have a membership"},{"start":117,"text":"available on YouTube. You can join my"},{"start":120,"text":"membership for private videos within the"},{"start":126,"text":"membership community and private"},{"start":128,"text":"conversations within the community as"},{"start":131,"text":"well."},{"start":132,"text":"Please like this video and subscribe and"},{"start":137,"text":"let's go for a walk."},{"start":139,"text":"I have my wide-brimmed"},{"start":143,"text":"hat on"},{"start":145,"text":"because it is very sunny."},{"start":149,"text":"I'm going to point out a few things"},{"start":154,"text":"around me so that you can learn some new"},{"start":158,"text":"vocabulary."},{"start":159,"text":"I am walking behind my husband"},{"start":163,"text":"on"},{"start":164,"text":"the pavement"},{"start":166,"text":"on the sidewalk."},{"start":168,"text":"These bushes"},{"start":171,"text":"are called hedges."},{"start":175,"text":"And hedges usually are"},{"start":179,"text":"taller than the height of a house"},{"start":185,"text":"due to privacy reasons."},{"start":187,"text":"That is a very big house."},{"start":191,"text":"It is"},{"start":192,"text":"a modern farmhouse style."},{"start":196,"text":"There are many palm trees."},{"start":199,"text":"Oh, look at this"},{"start":201,"text":"lemon or orange tree."},{"start":205,"text":"We see a lot of these in California."},{"start":212,"text":"Look at this lovely garden here."},{"start":217,"text":"My husband is standing in the middle of"},{"start":220,"text":"the road."},{"start":222,"text":"This is the house number"},{"start":225,"text":"and you will see this often"},{"start":228,"text":"throughout the streets of LA"},{"start":232,"text":"if you live"},{"start":233,"text":"in"},{"start":235,"text":"a single-family home."},{"start":238,"text":"Look at this brand new"},{"start":241,"text":"house that is getting built."},{"start":244,"text":"It's really nice."},{"start":246,"text":"A house like this can take several years"},{"start":250,"text":"to get built."},{"start":252,"text":"That house is made out of brick"},{"start":256,"text":"a lot of glass."},{"start":259,"text":"They probably get a lot of natural light"},{"start":262,"text":"in there."},{"start":264,"text":"Do you know"},{"start":266,"text":"what these white flowers are called?"},{"start":270,"text":"These type of"},{"start":273,"text":"plants are called succulents."},{"start":277,"text":"They do not require a lot of water to"},{"start":282,"text":"stay alive."},{"start":284,"text":"Did you know that certain houseplants"},{"start":288,"text":"are toxic or dangerous"},{"start":292,"text":"especially to cats?"},{"start":295,"text":"That"},{"start":296,"text":"is a weird-looking house."},{"start":299,"text":"It looks like a museum."},{"start":305,"text":"My husband is waiting for me across the"},{"start":308,"text":"street."},{"start":310,"text":"This house"},{"start":311,"text":"looks a little creepy to me."},{"start":316,"text":"Do you know the word creepy?"},{"start":320,"text":"It's like"},{"start":322,"text":"spooky"},{"start":324,"text":"or"},{"start":325,"text":"scary."},{"start":328,"text":"There are many cracks"},{"start":331,"text":"in the sidewalk."},{"start":335,"text":"A fancy word for describing a"},{"start":339,"text":"neighborhood"},{"start":341,"text":"that looks very rich and wealthy"},{"start":345,"text":"is affluent."},{"start":348,"text":"This is an interesting"},{"start":352,"text":"garden."},{"start":353,"text":"There is steel"},{"start":355,"text":"surrounding the tree."},{"start":359,"text":"Do you know what steel is?"},{"start":362,"text":"It's that brown material."},{"start":366,"text":"It smells really nice here because of"},{"start":369,"text":"all the"},{"start":370,"text":"honeysuckles."},{"start":373,"text":"That is the name of these flowers."},{"start":377,"text":"Honeysuckle."},{"start":379,"text":"Actually, I think these flowers are"},{"start":382,"text":"called jasmine."},{"start":385,"text":"I'm not sure. They have a similar smell."},{"start":390,"text":"The"},{"start":391,"text":"aesthetic of this"},{"start":394,"text":"house"},{"start":395,"text":"is very"},{"start":397,"text":"tropical feeling."},{"start":399,"text":"I could see this house"},{"start":402,"text":"in Florida."},{"start":405,"text":"This street is very peaceful."},{"start":410,"text":"There are not"},{"start":412,"text":"too many cars."},{"start":414,"text":"There's not"},{"start":416,"text":"a lot of traffic."},{"start":419,"text":"This is a very contemporary style house."},{"start":424,"text":"Look at these beautiful"},{"start":427,"text":"bushes of"},{"start":430,"text":"Actually, I shouldn't call them bushes."},{"start":432,"text":"They're"},{"start":434,"text":"some sort of grass. It's a tall fluffy"},{"start":438,"text":"grass."},{"start":441,"text":"Do you know the word fluffy?"},{"start":444,"text":"Think of like a cloud, a fluffy cloud."},{"start":450,"text":"I am now walking in the shade"},{"start":455,"text":"out of the sun."},{"start":458,"text":"And now I am in the sun."},{"start":464,"text":"And I'm in the shade."},{"start":468,"text":"I see"},{"start":470,"text":"the shadows of the leaves and branches."},{"start":477,"text":"This is a stop sign."},{"start":481,"text":"And that sign over there"},{"start":484,"text":"is the"},{"start":487,"text":"parking sign that says that you are only"},{"start":491,"text":"allowed to park on the street"},{"start":495,"text":"for 2 hours"},{"start":498,"text":"unless you have a parking permit."},{"start":503,"text":"A parking permit"},{"start":505,"text":"looks like a"},{"start":507,"text":"plastic sign"},{"start":510,"text":"that is attached to the rearview mirror"},{"start":516,"text":"of your car, inside of the car."},{"start":521,"text":"I just walked across a puddle."},{"start":526,"text":"A puddle is"},{"start":528,"text":"a lot of water."},{"start":530,"text":"Somebody is"},{"start":532,"text":"watering"},{"start":534,"text":"their grass"},{"start":536,"text":"with a hose."},{"start":539,"text":"I like the shape of these leaves."},{"start":543,"text":"I don't see too many of these types of"},{"start":547,"text":"trees in Los Angeles."},{"start":552,"text":"It smells really nice out here."},{"start":558,"text":"Trees"},{"start":560,"text":"breathe out"},{"start":562,"text":"oxygen"},{"start":564,"text":"and they breathe in"},{"start":566,"text":"carbon dioxide."},{"start":569,"text":"Humans"},{"start":571,"text":"breathe in oxygen"},{"start":573,"text":"and we breathe out carbon dioxide."},{"start":578,"text":"We are walking down"},{"start":581,"text":"this alley"},{"start":583,"text":"to go to"},{"start":586,"text":"what's called the Brentwood Country"},{"start":589,"text":"Mart."},{"start":591,"text":"I have been here before in one of my"},{"start":594,"text":"videos."},{"start":596,"text":"We might get"},{"start":599,"text":"some ice cream."},{"start":601,"text":"Would you like some ice cream?"},{"start":605,"text":"The style"},{"start":607,"text":"and aesthetic of this shopping"},{"start":611,"text":"center"},{"start":613,"text":"is a farm style."},{"start":616,"text":"That's why it's called a CountryMart."},{"start":621,"text":"As you can see,"},{"start":623,"text":"there are a lot of expensive"},{"start":626,"text":"cars and I almost"},{"start":628,"text":"just got ran over by one."},{"start":632,"text":"Like this G Wagon."},{"start":634,"text":"That's a very expensive car,"},{"start":637,"text":"especially with the custom paint."},{"start":640,"text":"We have"},{"start":642,"text":"the expensive Range Rover,"},{"start":645,"text":"the expensive Mercedes."},{"start":649,"text":"We have"},{"start":650,"text":"Tesla."},{"start":652,"text":"It is very popular to have a matte black"},{"start":657,"text":"car like this."},{"start":659,"text":"Matte black means"},{"start":662,"text":"it's not shiny."},{"start":665,"text":"Can you see?"},{"start":668,"text":"Now we are heading"},{"start":670,"text":"towards"},{"start":672,"text":"the other shopping center."},{"start":675,"text":"I think"},{"start":677,"text":"he wants to go shopping."},{"start":680,"text":"We are going in this"},{"start":683,"text":"clothing store"},{"start":685,"text":"called Theory."},{"start":694,"text":"Do you know what"},{"start":697,"text":"this"},{"start":698,"text":"statue is called?"},{"start":701,"text":"It's called a mannequin."},{"start":704,"text":"Now I'm heading down the stairs."},{"start":709,"text":"We're going to the CountryMart again."},{"start":715,"text":"We are entering"},{"start":717,"text":"the CountryMart."},{"start":719,"text":"How cute are these doors?"},{"start":723,"text":"I wonder how old this building is."},{"start":731,"text":"I love this bag for the summer."},{"start":736,"text":"Sorry, my camera was not pointing down."},{"start":739,"text":"This bag."},{"start":741,"text":"And I like that bucket hat, as well."},{"start":751,"text":"These are nice"},{"start":752,"text":"glass pitchers."},{"start":759,"text":"And a lot of nice home decor."},{"start":770,"text":"This is where you can ship out your"},{"start":774,"text":"mail."},{"start":775,"text":"A cute little"},{"start":778,"text":"mail"},{"start":780,"text":"post office."},{"start":784,"text":"Some fine jewelry."},{"start":788,"text":"Fine jewelry means expensive."},{"start":792,"text":"Now we are in"},{"start":794,"text":"Farmshop."},{"start":796,"text":"I have filmed here before."},{"start":800,"text":"An assortment of"},{"start":802,"text":"artisanal chocolate."},{"start":805,"text":"We have"},{"start":807,"text":"a bunch of"},{"start":809,"text":"chocolate"},{"start":811,"text":"desserts here."},{"start":814,"text":"And some pecans."},{"start":817,"text":"Or you might hear some American say"},{"start":820,"text":"pecan."},{"start":822,"text":"I think pecan sounds better."},{"start":825,"text":"We have beef jerky, if you would like"},{"start":829,"text":"some protein."},{"start":833,"text":"Some"},{"start":834,"text":"meat and salami."},{"start":837,"text":"We have flour to make"},{"start":841,"text":"muffins"},{"start":843,"text":"and cookies."},{"start":846,"text":"There's some"},{"start":848,"text":"wine over here, specifically"},{"start":852,"text":"rosé."},{"start":855,"text":"We have tequila."},{"start":857,"text":"Who likes tequila?"},{"start":859,"text":"Let me know in the comments."},{"start":864,"text":"We also have some chilled wine, which"},{"start":867,"text":"means it is cold."},{"start":870,"text":"And some sake."},{"start":872,"text":"What is this? These tiny little cans."},{"start":876,"text":"These are"},{"start":877,"text":"tequila cocktails. Look how cute these"},{"start":882,"text":"tequila cocktails are."},{"start":885,"text":"It makes me want to drink one."},{"start":888,"text":"And look at the sparkling sake."},{"start":890,"text":"Would you want one?"},{"start":893,"text":"We are heading back"},{"start":895,"text":"towards our car"},{"start":897,"text":"and then we will be driving home"},{"start":903,"text":"later today."},{"start":905,"text":"I hope to"},{"start":907,"text":"have time to watch a movie at home."},{"start":912,"text":"I need to clean up my house."},{"start":916,"text":"It looks like a tornado came through the"},{"start":919,"text":"house."},{"start":921,"text":"That is"},{"start":923,"text":"a saying, which means it's a mess."},{"start":928,"text":"I have"},{"start":930,"text":"clothes I need to fold and put away."},{"start":936,"text":"I need to prepare for dinner."},{"start":941,"text":"I also need to take"},{"start":944,"text":"Nari, my dog, for a walk."},{"start":949,"text":"Ooh, look at this house."},{"start":951,"text":"That's a nice house."},{"start":953,"text":"I love the black"},{"start":957,"text":"panes on the window."},{"start":960,"text":"Look at these beautiful flowers."},{"start":965,"text":"The petals"},{"start":967,"text":"are"},{"start":969,"text":"symmetrical."},{"start":973,"text":"And we also have this beautiful purple"},{"start":976,"text":"flower."},{"start":979,"text":"This looks like"},{"start":981,"text":"rosemary."},{"start":983,"text":"What are you up to today?"},{"start":988,"text":"That means what plans do you have today?"},{"start":994,"text":"Let me know"},{"start":996,"text":"in the comments."},{"start":998,"text":"I hope you enjoyed today's slow English"},{"start":1003,"text":"vlog."},{"start":1005,"text":"And I have a lot"},{"start":1009,"text":"of vlogs like this"},{"start":1011,"text":"when I first started on YouTube about a"},{"start":1014,"text":"year ago."},{"start":1016,"text":"So please check out my older videos."},{"start":1021,"text":"I put a lot of heart and soul into them."},{"start":1026,"text":"I will see you next time."},{"start":1029,"text":"Bye."}]}